<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Hungering-Touch</ansi> (enchanting recipe)

Parasitic tendrils fuse with the blade, feeding on the lifeblood of
those it strikes.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Recipe ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       enchanting (minimum 30)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     enchanting circle
  <ansi fg="yellow">Target:</ansi>      weapon (must be equipped)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> chrysalis setting (x2), mutation catalyst (x2),
                binding paste (x1)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Time:</ansi>        6 rounds
  <ansi fg="yellow">Reserve:</ansi>     health (1% at tier 0, scaling with tier)

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Effect ━━━</ansi>

Heals the wielder for a portion of physical damage dealt.

The enchantment grows stronger through combat use, advancing
through five tiers of increasing power and reserve cost.

